      "horizon_days": 30.0,
      "anchor_statement": "Tiling is anchored to the FIXED calendar date 2005-01-01 (grid.T0_START); window k has t0 = 2005-01-01 + 30.0*k days. It is NOT anchored to the catalogue start, to month boundaries, or to the split dates. Step = 30 days = the horizon, so windows tile contiguously and DO NOT overlap.",
